        "text": "Yolonda Morris has represented the 9th District in the Illinois House since September 2023. She was a certified nursing assistant for 26 years before working as a union organizer for SEIU. Her campaign says she advocates for a $15 minimum wage, expanded child care access and safe staffing standards.",
